      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T08:00:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With this, a missing key-id is no longer an immediate device failure: NetconfNodeHandler catches the UnsupportedConfigurationException at line 274, logs it at DEBUG and retries, and max-connection-attempts defaults to 0 (forever), so a typo\u0027d key-id leaves the node \"connecting\" with nothing visible. Could the catch in NetconfNodeHandler.lockedConnect log at WARN (at least on the first attempt) so the reason is not lost?",
      "revId": "f8ad8f486f31098657652bed577af8b57c9359d0",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "314224d6_fb4f07fe",
        "filename": "apps/netconf-topology/src/main/java/org/opendaylight/netconf/topology/spi/NetconfClientConfigurationBuilderFactoryImpl.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 123,
      "author": {
        "id": 8449
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-20T16:39:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks, done. NetconfNodeHandler.lockedConnect() now logs the UnsupportedConfigurationException at WARN on the first attempt. Later attempts usually fail the same way, so they stay at DEBUG and do not flood the log while the node keeps retrying.",
      "parentUuid": "22102d95_c6dc79ca",
      "revId": "f8ad8f486f31098657652bed577af8b57c9359d0",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "38e05904_32ddf67a",
        "filename": "apps/netconf-topology/src/main/java/org/opendaylight/netconf/topology/spi/NetconfClientConfigurationBuilderFactoryImpl.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 123,
      "author": {
        "id": 8324
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-21T08:08:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not sufficient. The single WARN is easy to miss. Could we also surface the reason in the node\u0027s status on the first failed attempt, not only in the log? Or something like that...",
      "parentUuid": "314224d6_fb4f07fe",
      "revId": "f8ad8f486f31098657652bed577af8b57c9359d0",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
